# Logs
**/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Dependency directories
**/node_modules/
**/jspm_packages/

# Build artifacts
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/dist-electron/
**/build/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# Android specific
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.dm
**/capt-generated/
**/.externalNativeBuild
**/.cxx
**/android/app/release/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/gradle.properties

# Inspection and lint reports
**/android/*.xml
**/android/*.html

# OS metadata
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db

